	(text_box "Basic 101 keyboard with USB and SPI interfaces\n2 layer PCB and Cherry footprints\n\nThe STM32G0 MCU is LQFP64\nBreakout:\n- 2 pins UART\n- 2 pins USB data\n- 2 pins SPI\n- 1 pin BOOT0?\n- 2 pins SWD\n- VREF = GND\n- VBAT ?\n- VDD VSS NRST\n\nMatrix:\n17 x 6 : for 75%, no keypad\n21 x 6 for full 101\n\nCOLUMNS 21: PB0 to PB15, PC6, PC7, PC13-15\nROWS 6: PA0-PA4, PA8\n\nDiodes are all 1N4148 (0803)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 337.82 17.78 0)
		(size 66.04 43.18)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
